Backport of upstream pip fix for CVE-2026-8643: reject entry point names
that escape the scripts directory (path traversal via ``console_scripts`` /
``gui_scripts`` entry point names). Consolidates the three upstream commits
that landed in pip 26.1.2:

  8eb17848 Reject entry point names that escape scripts dir (#14000)
  7ff8bdd8 Fix is_within_directory for doubled-slash roots
  fa7854f6 Use is_within_directory for entry point check

Adapted onto pip 23.2.1 (Python 3.7+ typing preserved: Optional[Dict],
List). is_within_directory is already imported in the target wheel.py.

Note: the upstream test additions (tests/unit/test_utils_unpacking.py,
tests/unit/test_wheel.py) are intentionally dropped here because the pip
23.2.1 PyPI sdist (used by app-patcher as the source tarball) does not
ship a ``tests/`` directory. The fix is entirely in the shipped code
(src/pip/_internal/...); the tests were validated separately against a
git checkout of pip 23.2.1 during patch authoring.

Origin: upstream, https://github.com/pypa/pip/commit/8eb178480bd1a2b223f509fc430796b265158dfb
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/pypa/pip/commit/7ff8bdd81ec5edca2bebf78ad8506dda710d6af5
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/pypa/pip/commit/fa7854f6b37113a2c4698cdde902e1fcc9bebdd5

